         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               AberrationInspectorTG 2.2.0 introduces a refreshed interface. Open the script first, then select or load an image or preview. Apply repeatedly without closing the dialog, reset settings, and save reusable process instances. The output summary shows effective panel dimensions after automatic fitting. Includes updated documentation and a new interface screenshot.
            </p>
